					<li>Dinner Nights with Trivia</li>
					<li>Board Game Nights</li>
					<li>Arcade Nights</li>
					<li>Card Game Tournaments</li>
					<li>Computer Lan Parties</li>
					<li>Nature Walks and Camping</li>
					<li>Paintball</li>
					<li>Pokemon Go</li>			
					<li>Escape Rooms</li>
					<li>Card Game Tournaments</li>
					<li>Medevil times</li>
				</ol>
				<p>Please Note that we take event suggestions! There is an event signup and event suggestion form on this website!</p>
			</div>
	</div>

</div>

